# Worlds Beyond: a minute among other worlds, with no one in it - a showcase of the renderer's planets, air, cities, aurora, a lava world, a comet, a spinning
# station, a dogfight and a jump to hyperspace (src/shared/cartoon/film_planets.h, film_cosmos.h, film_voyage.h, film_battle.h). Seven parts on the empty stage.
film    worlds-beyond
name    Worlds Beyond
about   A minute among other worlds: a blue planet turning into night with its cities and aurora, a lava world, a comet, a station, a dogfight and a jump to hyperspace.
